"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4508600","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4376500-1842846814449293","game_id":"steam-4376500","kind":"update","title":"🎮 0.7.6Version Update — New Chaos Gameplay Officially Launched","summary":"From 0.7.5 to 0.7.6, we touched more than 900 files. If 0.7.5 taught battle to stand on solid ground, 0.7.6 does something far more fundamental — we put Chaos Purification on center stage. Battle used to be a checklist: eliminate these targets, reach these conditions, finish before time runs out… Not anymore. In 0.7.6, every battle shares one lifeline running through the whole fight: the Chaos bar. You no longer match gems to \"complete tasks\" — you match to purify the battlefield. Your goal has ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T15:48:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449293","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4376500-1837955055366176","game_id":"steam-4376500","kind":"update","title":"🎮 0.7.5 Update — Comprehensive upgrade of combat architecture","summary":"From 0.7.4 to 0.7.5, we have touched over 1,000 files. This is not a patch with a few tweaks — we have nearly rebuilt the Demo's foundation: the battle core, the input framework, the shader pipeline, the startup flow, and the automated testing backbone. If 0.7.4 made every match feel better, 0.7.5 is what makes the whole fight stand on solid ground. ⚔️ Battle Architecture Upgrade Large-Scale Battle System RefactorWe have redrawn the boundaries between state management, rule resolution, visual pr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T13:54:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055366176","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4376500-1835871199307715","game_id":"steam-4376500","kind":"update","title":"🎮 0.7.4 Update — Combat Feel, Fully Upgraded","summary":"Since the Demo launch, one thing you kept telling us: \"The combat feel could be better.\" We heard you. 0.7.4 has one focus: making every swipe and every match feel fantastic. 🖐️ More Responsive Controls Precise 8-direction swipe detection — your intent, captured instantly No more dropped inputs during rapid play — speed demons, bring it on Dual input modes: swipe or tap, switch anytime 👆 Instant Visual Feedback Gems highlight the moment you touch them — zero lag Clear visual distinction between ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T16:45:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199307715","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4376500-1835236783563928","game_id":"steam-4376500","kind":"announcement","title":"🔥 Demo Is Now Live","summary":"🎉 The Moment Has Arrived After 2 months of refinement, the free demo for Miracle Mage: Awakened Elements is officially live on Steam. Here, every match is a strategic choice, and every defeat is a step toward awakening. The demo takes you into the Elemental Academy — from your admission trial to graduation, experience a complete story-driven adventure. Meet your mentors and companions, master the elemental forces on a 6×9 board, and face powerful foes in the Backhill Trials. Download for free. B","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T15:58:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783563928","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4376500-1826362059926555","game_id":"steam-4376500","kind":"announcement","title":"is now live on Steam!","summary":"Dear players,We are thrilled to announce that the Steam store page for \\ is officially live! This marks an important milestone in our development journey, and it means you can now add the game to your wishlist to stay updated on future news and Early Access plans.In the coming months, we will continue to share:Developer logsGameplay showcasesPlaytest plansRoadmap for Early AccessWe truly look forward to hearing your feedback and suggestions. Feel free to leave comments in the community discussio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-07T12:14:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059926555","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4376500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:32Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:32Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4376500":"2026-10-26T12:09:32Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4376500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:32Z"},"4508600":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:09:32Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4376500","app_id":4376500,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:34Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"e64bff21589f5fe918a4e5f672fd9e1de1522737358cc437aa4e8a619816